flow explore fixtures                                                           
→ help 1-16 of 17, up/down scrolls, ? or esc closes ────────────────────────────
Move                                                                            
  up k      move up a row                                                       
  down j    move down a row                                                     
  enter     open or close the row (click does the same)                         
  right l   open the row                                                        
  left h    close the row, or go to its parent                                  
  PgUp      up a page                                                           
  PgDn      down a page                                                         
  home      first row                                                           
  end G     last row                                                            
                                                                                
Screen                                                                          
  f         filter workflows by name; enter keeps it, esc clears it             
  r         read the files and the server again, keeping what is open           
  ?         show or hide this help                                              
  q ctrl+d  leave                                                               
                                                                                
f filter  r refresh  ? help  q quit                                             
